.nh
.TH runc-resume "8"

.SH "نام (NAME)"
\fBrunc-resume\fP \- resume all processes that have been previously paused


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBrunc resume\fP \fIcontainer-id\fP


.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
The \fBresume\fP command resumes all processes in the instance of the container
identified by \fIcontainer-id\fP\&.

.PP
Use \fBrunc list\fP to identify instances of containers and their current status.


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBrunc-list\fP(8),
\fBrunc-pause\fP(8),
\fBrunc\fP(8).
